cook frogs, first remove the slime using white wine,Comment: 0,0:07:21.87,0:07:21.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To cook frogs, first remove the slime using white wine,Comment: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:21.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To cook frogs, first remove the slime using white wine,Comment: 0,0:07:21.96,0:07:22.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To cook frogs, first remove the slime using white wine,Comment: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:22.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To cook frogs, first remove the slime using white wine,Comment: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:25.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To cook frogs, first remove the slime using white wine,Comment: 0,0:07:25.25,0:07:27.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then dust them in flour  and fry them till crisp.Comment: 0,0:07:27.30,0:07:27.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then dust them in flour  and fry them till crisp.Comment: 0,0:07:27.34,0:07:27.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then dust them in flour  and fry them till crisp.Comment: 0,0:07:27.38,0:07:27.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then dust them in flour  and fry them till crisp.Comment: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:27.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji-kun !Comment: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:27.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji-kun !Comment: 0,0:07:27.51,0:07:27.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji-kun !Comment: 0,0:07:27.55,0:07:28.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji-kun !Comment: 0,0:07:28.80,0:07:28.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji-kun !Comment: 0,0:07:28.84,0:07:28.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji-kun !Comment: 0,0:07:28.88,0:07:28.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji-kun !Comment: 0,0:07:28.92,0:07:28.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If our captain says we're going,  what choice do we have but to go?Comment: 0,0:07:28.97,0:07:29.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If our captain says we're going,  what choice do we have but to go?Comment: 0,0:07:29.01,0:07:29.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If our captain says we're going,  what choice do we have but to go?Comment: 0,0:07:29.05,0:07:33.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If our captain says we're going,  what choice do we have but to go?Comment: 0,0:07:33.01,0:07:33.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If our captain says we're going,  what choice do we have but to go?Comment: 0,0:07:33.05,0:07:33.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If our captain says we're going,  what choice do we have but to go?Comment: 0,0:07:33.14,0:07:33.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If our captain says we're going,  what choice do we have but to go?Comment: 0,0:07:33.18,0:07:33.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If our captain says we're going,  what choice do we have but to go?Comment: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:33.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If our captain says we're going,  what choice do we have but to go?Comment: 0,0:07:33.26,0:07:33.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If our captain says we're going,  what choice do we have but to go?Comment: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:33.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If our captain says we're going,  what choice do we have but to go?Comment: 0,0:07:33.34,0:07:33.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!Comment: 0,0:07:33.39,0:07:33.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!Comment: 0,0:07:33.43,0:07:33.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!Comment: 0,0:07:33.47,0:07:33.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!Comment: 0,0:07:33.51,0:07:33.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!Comment: 0,0:07:33.55,0:07:35.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.08,0:01:54.17,Title,,0,0,0,,The City of Water, Water SevenDialogue: 1,0:01:50.08,0:01:54.17,Title,,0,0,0,,The City of Water, Water SevenDialogue: 5,0:01:54.31,0:01:58.20,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Luffy and Robin needed some recovery time, so the Going Merry dropped anchor...Dialogue: 5,0:01:58.20,0:02:00.89,Narrator,,0,0,0,,off the uninhabited island for four days.Dialogue: 5,0:02:00.89,0:02:02.62,Narrator,,0,0,0,,After that, we set sail.Dialogue: 5,0:02:02.62,0:02:05.85,Narrator,,0,0,0,,This is the third morning  since we resumed our voyage.Dialogue: 5,0:02:05.85,0:02:08.69,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Today's weather is a gorgeous mix of spring,Dialogue: 5,0:02:09.61,0:02:11.31,Narrator,,0,0,0,,peppered with occasional bouts of summer.Dialogue: 5,0:02:16.70,0:02:18.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful day!Dialogue: 5,0:02:19.09,0:02:22.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami-swan! Dialogue: 5,0:02:25.60,0:02:30.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I made potato paille.  Mademoiselle, if you would.Dialogue: 5,0:02:32.42,0:02:34.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mmm, it's delicious!Dialogue: 5,0:02:34.10,0:02:36.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm overjoyed!Dialogue: 5,0:02:36.68,0:02:39.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep it down! I'm trying to sleep!Dialogue: 5,0:02:39.47,0:02:43.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, sorry  about that, cactus head.Dialogue: 5,0:02:43.00,0:02:45.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What'd you say, dartboard brows?!Dialogue: 5,0:02:45.31,0:02:47.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dar– What'd you  just say, you bastard?!Dialogue: 5,0:02:47.95,0:02:50.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dartboard brows.Dialogue: 5,0:02:53.64,0:02:57.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Yeah! Luffy! All right!Dialogue: 5,0:02:57.61,0:03:02.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Yeah! Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:03:04.43,0:03:06.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's about time!Dialogue: 5,0:03:05.64,0:03:06.98,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:03:13.79,0:03:16.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My frozen-self reenactment.Dialogue: 5,0:03:23.72,0:03:27.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geez. I can't believe he's doing  that after he got frozen and almost died.Dialogue: 5,0:03:29.74,0:03:33.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Was it close?  – You nailed it! That was exactly it, Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:03:33.48,0:03:35.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Clean that up good, okay, Luffy?!Dialogue: 5,0:03:35.87,0:03:38.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? What're you eating, Nami?Dialogue: 5,0:03:38.86,0:03:41.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's paille, a potato dish.Dialogue: 5,0:03:41.94,0:03:45.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Potato, huh? I'm hungry too. Hey, Sanji!Dialogue: 5,0:03:45.24,0:03:48.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just how much sleep do  you need anyway?!Dialogue: 5,0:03:48.96,0:03:52.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How much sleep I need is my business!  If you wanna have a go, then bring it on!Dialogue: 5,0:04:03.59,0:04:06.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They said this is called paille. It's good!Dialogue: 5,0:04:06.30,0:04:08.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's a paille?Dialogue: 5,0:04:08.58,0:04:12.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the tail meat of a  huge monster named Paille.Dialogue: 5,0:04:12.65,0:04:16.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I killed it. It was  at least 100 meters high.Dialogue: 5,0:04:16.80,0:04:19.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,100 meters?! That's amazing, Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:04:19.46,0:04:21.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm, piece of cake.  I did it before breakfast.Dialogue: 5,0:04:21.61,0:04:24.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? You got up  early and killed it?Dialogue: 5,0:04:24.26,0:04:27.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper, say my name.Dialogue: 5,0:04:27.49,0:04:31.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? That's, of course, C-Captain...Dialogue: 5,0:04:31.08,0:04:35.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right! My name is...  Captain... Usopp–Dialogue: 5,0:04:37.42,0:04:39.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 5,0:04:39.34,0:04:42.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Robin-chwan !Dialogue: 5,0:04:42.50,0:04:43.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 5,0:04:43.72,0:04:46.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?  Are you chilly?Dialogue: 5,0:04:46.51,0:04:50.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling a lot better,  all thanks to an amazing doctor.Dialogue: 5,0:04:50.97,0:04:56.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, being called an amazing doctor  won't make me feel happy or anything, you jerk.Dialogue: 5,0:04:56.60,0:04:58.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– He sure does look happy.  – Yeah.Dialogue: 5,0:04:58.44,0:05:00.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, Robin.Dialogue: 5,0:05:00.27,0:05:03.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't feel pressured just because Luffy is up and about,Dialogue: 5,0:05:03.33,0:05:05.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,despite having experienced the same thing as you.Dialogue: 5,0:05:05.17,0:05:07.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can take your time and rest, you know.Dialogue: 5,0:05:07.16,0:05:09.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yay!  – That's not a compliment!Dialogue: 5,0:05:09.73,0:05:13.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin-chan ! Shall I make  something to warm you up?Dialogue: 5,0:05:13.23,0:05:14.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How's your appetite?Dialogue: 5,0:05:15.38,0:05:18.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, may I have some coffee?Dialogue: 5,0:05:18.30,0:05:21.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right! It'd be my pleasure!Dialogue: 5,0:05:35.69,0:05:36.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 5,0:05:37.56,0:05:38.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that?Dialogue: 5,0:05:46.07,0:05:50.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, this paille thing is so good,  we can't stop eating it.Dialogue: 5,0:05:50.26,0:05:52.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's yummy!Dialogue: 5,0:05:52.00,0:05:54.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, if we sell this stuff,  wouldn't it rake in the dough?Dialogue: 5,0:05:54.04,0:05:55.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:05:55.37,0:05:58.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A-A frog is doing the front crawl!Dialogue: 5,0:05:58.30,0:05:59.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 5,0:05:59.46,0:06:01.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It went to your side,  so take a look!Dialogue: 5,0:06:01.48,0:06:04.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Is that true?  – A frog? Like, a real frog?Dialogue: 5,0:06:04.38,0:06:09.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, are you seriously taking stock in what ol' King Stupid said?Dialogue: 5,0:06:09.47,0:06:12.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For starters, it's impossible for frogs to do the front cra– It's doing it!Dialogue: 5,0:06:12.41,0:06:14.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A-A frog is doing the front crawl!Dialogue: 5,0:06:14.31,0:06:16.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Let's follow it, guys!  – Yeah!Dialogue: 5,0:06:16.99,0:06:20.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Furl the sail! Stand by the oars!  Turn the ship to 2 o'clock!Dialogue: 5,0:06:20.80,0:06:22.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah!  – Faster!Dialogue: 5,0:06:22.89,0:06:26.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't explain it, but I get the feeling we need to chase it!Dialogue: 5,0:06:27.04,0:06:29.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting, mademoiselles.Dialogue: 5,0:06:31.64,0:06:32.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 5,0:06:32.83,0:06:34.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! What happened?!Dialogue: 5,0:06:37.80,0:06:39.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It feels like the ship changed course.Dialogue: 5,0:06:39.96,0:06:44.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys! Who said you could change course without consulting me?!Dialogue: 5,0:06:44.42,0:06:46.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami, you've got to hear this!Dialogue: 5,0:06:46.65,0:06:49.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We found a huge frog  with scars all over its body!Dialogue: 5,0:06:50.10,0:06:51.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the heck?Dialogue: 5,0:06:51.68,0:06:55.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The plan's to roast it whole and eat it!Dialogue: 5,0:06:55.24,0:06:56.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're gonna eat it?!Dialogue: 5,0:06:57.89,0:06:59.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're right.Dialogue: 5,0:07:00.30,0:07:02.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? A lighthouse?Dialogue: 5,0:07:03.60,0:07:08.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why is there a lighthouse in a place like this?  Is anyone even there?Dialogue: 5,0:07:08.15,0:07:10.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What do you see?  Is it an island?Dialogue: 5,0:07:10.53,0:07:14.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, it's a lighthouse. The log pose wouldn't point to a place like this.Dialogue: 5,0:07:14.87,0:07:17.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the frog?  Tell us where the frog swam to!Dialogue: 5,0:07:17.79,0:07:18.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!Dialogue: 5,0:07:18.91,0:07:21.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The frog is headed to the lighthouse.Dialogue: 5,0:07:21.44,0:07:22.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 5,0:07:22.40,0:07:25.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To cook frogs, first remove the slime using white wine,Dialogue: 5,0:07:25.25,0:07:27.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then dust them in flour  and fry them till crisp.Dialogue: 5,0:07:27.46,0:07:28.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji-kun! Dialogue: 5,0:07:28.97,0:07:33.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If our captain says we're going,  what choice do we have but to go?Dialogue: 5,0:07:33.18,0:07:35.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 5,0:07:35.18,0:07:38.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right! Full speed ahead!Dialogue: 5,0:07:38.24,0:07:39.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 5,0:07:39.24,0:07:41.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How are you all in agreement?!Dialogue: 5,0:07:41.14,0:07:44.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!Dialogue: 5,0:07:49.90,0:07:51.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's flying!Dialogue: 5,0:07:51.80,0:07:55.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let it get away! Move  ahead of it and block its course!Dialogue: 5,0:07:55.24,0:07:59.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!Dialogue: 5,0:08:11.89,0:08:13.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We ran aground on something!Dialogue: 5,0:08:16.18,0:08:19.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahh, Nami-san, Robin-chan,  are you two okay?Dialogue: 5,0:08:19.39,0:08:21.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, luckily.Dialogue: 5,0:08:21.99,0:08:23.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm okay.Dialogue: 5,0:08:24.42,0:08:27.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good. Hm?Dialogue: 5,0:08:27.36,0:08:30.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? What's that sound?Dialogue: 5,0:08:30.81,0:08:32.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? What's going on?Dialogue: 5,0:08:48.37,0:08:50.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is this...? Don't tell me...Dialogue: 5,0:08:58.35,0:09:00.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why? In a place like this?!Dialogue: 5,0:09:00.81,0:09:03.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow!Dialogue: 5,0:09:05.55,0:09:08.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go back! Go back!  Rotate 180 degrees!Dialogue: 5,0:09:27.25,0:09:29.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?!Dialogue: 5,0:09:32.17,0:09:34.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What in the world is this hulking piece of iron?!Dialogue: 5,0:09:34.80,0:09:36.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A ship?Dialogue: 5,0:09:36.26,0:09:39.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not possible! Something shaped  like this isn't seaworthy!Dialogue: 5,0:09:43.22,0:09:45.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, frog! Run! What're you doing?!Dialogue: 5,0:09:53.90,0:09:56.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahhh! It got run over!Dialogue: 5,0:10:21.26,0:10:23.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The ship was puffing out smoke!Dialogue: 5,0:10:34.38,0:10:35.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirates?Dialogue: 5,0:10:35.61,0:10:38.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grandma! Grandma! Pirates are here!Dialogue: 5,0:10:38.36,0:10:41.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Is that so, Chimney?!Dialogue: 5,0:10:41.74,0:10:45.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay then, bring  the transponder snail to me!Dialogue: 5,0:10:45.28,0:10:46.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 5,0:10:47.00,0:10:50.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a problem. Someone came out of the building.Dialogue: 5,0:10:50.12,0:10:52.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're gonna call for help.Dialogue: 5,0:10:53.25,0:10:54.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here it is, Grandma!Dialogue: 5,0:10:54.69,0:10:56.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Err, hello?Dialogue: 5,0:10:56.55,0:11:01.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's see. What was it? I forgot.Dialogue: 5,0:11:01.21,0:11:02.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's wasted?!Dialogue: 5,0:11:07.47,0:11:13.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? Paille, huh?  It goes good with booze.Dialogue: 5,0:11:13.08,0:11:15.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! This is tasty!Dialogue: 5,0:11:15.44,0:11:19.20,Main-207+,,0,0,8,,I'm Chimney. This is our cat, Gonbe,Dialogue: 5,0:11:19.20,0:11:20.69,Main-207+,,0,0,8,,and Grandma Kokoro.Dialogue: 5,0:11:20.69,0:11:24.83,Main-207+,,0,0,8,,You guys aren't train robbers, are you?Dialogue: 5,0:11:24.83,0:11:27.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Luffy. I'm the man  who'll be king of the pirates.Dialogue: 5,0:11:27.70,0:11:29.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Really?!  – Yeah.Dialogue: 5,0:11:30.00,0:11:31.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a funny guy.Dialogue: 5,0:11:31.96,0:11:34.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say, Chimney, that thing  is a steamship, right?Dialogue: 5,0:11:34.79,0:11:39.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But with a shape like that,  there's no way it could ever sail.Dialogue: 5,0:11:39.03,0:11:41.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've never seen anything  like it, have you?Dialogue: 5,0:11:41.17,0:11:43.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You won't find its equal anywhere else in the world. Dialogue: 5,0:11:43.72,0:11:47.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a sea train called  the Puffing Tom.Dialogue: 5,0:11:47.16,0:11:48.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Puffing Tom?Dialogue: 5,0:11:48.68,0:11:52.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Its steam engine turns paddlewheels while it travels along the sea railway.Dialogue: 5,0:11:55.61,0:11:56.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Railway?Dialogue: 5,0:11:56.79,0:12:00.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right. It floats just below the water's surface. Dialogue: 5,0:12:00.19,0:12:02.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The train travels  the same route every day,Dialogue: 5,0:12:02.69,0:12:05.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,taking passengers  from one island to another.Dialogue: 5,0:12:05.19,0:12:07.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It hauls ships and delivers the mail as well.Dialogue: 5,0:12:07.12,0:12:09.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's right. There really is a railway.Dialogue: 5,0:12:09.66,0:12:12.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep! The rails are marked off, and there's even a signal. Dialogue: 5,0:12:12.50,0:12:14.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous to go inside the barrier like that! Dialogue: 5,0:12:14.33,0:12:18.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dangerous or not,  that guy wouldn't understand, right?Dialogue: 5,0:12:18.39,0:12:22.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It wasn't nice to send him flying.  We saw him first.Dialogue: 5,0:12:22.09,0:12:24.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? "That guy"?  Are you talking about Yokozuna?Dialogue: 5,0:12:24.89,0:12:26.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep, that front crawl frog.Dialogue: 5,0:12:26.99,0:12:29.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yokozuna wouldn't die from that.Dialogue: 5,0:12:29.90,0:12:33.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's the source of all our  headaches here at Shift Station.Dialogue: 5,0:12:33.09,0:12:36.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He loves testing his strength by trying to defeat the sea train.Dialogue: 5,0:12:36.70,0:12:38.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He'll be back.Dialogue: 5,0:12:38.18,0:12:42.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Testing his strength? Oh! That's why he stood his ground, huh?Dialogue: 5,0:12:42.12,0:12:43.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's got guts.Dialogue: 5,0:12:43.72,0:12:46.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give me a break!  He's a royal pain!Dialogue: 5,0:12:46.37,0:12:49.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The grill also keeps getting broken!Dialogue: 5,0:12:49.45,0:12:53.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Every time he shows up,  the passengers freak out!Dialogue: 5,0:12:53.91,0:12:55.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think I get the big picture.Dialogue: 5,0:12:55.80,0:12:57.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, then!  I won't eat him!Dialogue: 5,0:12:57.71,0:12:59.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't eat a fighter! Dialogue: 5,0:12:59.44,0:13:01.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eating a frog should never  have entered your head!Dialogue: 5,0:13:01.80,0:13:05.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, you guys headed somewhere?Dialogue: 5,0:13:05.80,0:13:09.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna take  the sea train from here, there's:Dialogue: 5,0:13:10.70,0:13:16.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,St. Poplar, Town of the Spring Queen;  Pucci, the Gourmet Town;Dialogue: 5,0:13:16.14,0:13:20.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and San Faldo, the Carnival Town!  They're all fun places.Dialogue: 5,0:13:20.90,0:13:25.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you work for the government,  you'd take a separate, special train.Dialogue: 5,0:13:25.82,0:13:27.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, we'll pick the Gourmet Town.Dialogue: 5,0:13:27.46,0:13:28.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, we won't!Dialogue: 5,0:13:29.60,0:13:32.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since we've got our own ship,  we won't need the train.Dialogue: 5,0:13:32.50,0:13:33.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna follow our log.Dialogue: 5,0:13:33.70,0:13:35.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? Where's it pointing?Dialogue: 5,0:13:35.75,0:13:37.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,East of here.Dialogue: 5,0:13:37.54,0:13:41.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed? Then it must be Water Seven.Dialogue: 5,0:13:41.46,0:13:45.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The train you saw earlier came  from that island's Blue Station.Dialogue: 5,0:13:46.43,0:13:49.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's called the City of Water.  It's a fantastic place.Dialogue: 5,0:13:49.14,0:13:53.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's more, the city is known far and wide for its shipbuilding industry.Dialogue: 5,0:13:53.15,0:13:55.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their technology is unrivaled the world over!Dialogue: 5,0:13:55.11,0:14:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even the World Government favors  the ships built there! Amazing, right?Dialogue: 5,0:14:00.00,0:14:03.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way! Then there's gotta be  some amazing shipwrights, right?!Dialogue: 5,0:14:03.09,0:14:09.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not just "some"! It's a crossroads of the world's best shipwrights!Dialogue: 5,0:14:09.49,0:14:10.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:14:10.54,0:14:11.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 5,0:14:11.80,0:14:13.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right! I've decided!Dialogue: 5,0:14:13.60,0:14:16.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna go there and get a shipwright to join our crew for sure!Dialogue: 5,0:14:16.37,0:14:20.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that right?  Then hold on a sec.Dialogue: 5,0:14:20.36,0:14:22.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Up I go.Dialogue: 5,0:14:22.90,0:14:25.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What's she up to?  – Beats me.Dialogue: 5,0:14:25.17,0:14:30.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, then. Here's a basic map  of the island and a letter of introduction.Dialogue: 5,0:14:30.29,0:14:35.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hand this to a guy named Iceburg  and ask him to take good care of your ship.Dialogue: 5,0:14:35.60,0:14:38.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Water Seven is a big place.  Don't get lost.Dialogue: 5,0:14:38.94,0:14:40.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!Dialogue: 5,0:14:40.13,0:14:42.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have a heart of gold, Kokoro-san ! So kind!Dialogue: 5,0:14:47.39,0:14:50.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In a bit, we're gonna go back to Water Seven too.Dialogue: 5,0:14:50.91,0:14:56.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, true! If we meet again,  first round's on me at my favorite bar.Dialogue: 5,0:14:57.58,0:15:00.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay! I hope we see you guys again!Dialogue: 5,0:15:00.17,0:15:05.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At Water Seven, it'll take about a week for the log to register. Kick back and relax.Dialogue: 5,0:15:06.26,0:15:08.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Thanks!Dialogue: 5,0:15:09.80,0:15:13.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, guys!  Get ready to set sail!Dialogue: 5,0:15:13.40,0:15:15.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah!  – Well then, we're off!Dialogue: 5,0:15:15.20,0:15:18.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks for all your help,  Kokoro-san ! Chimney!Dialogue: 5,0:15:24.80,0:15:26.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Be careful!Dialogue: 5,0:15:28.82,0:15:32.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Watch out for the government people!Dialogue: 5,0:15:32.03,0:15:34.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Let's go!Dialogue: 5,0:15:34.95,0:15:39.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To the city of meat! Yahoo!Dialogue: 5,0:15:37.62,0:15:39.58,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Were you even listening?Dialogue: 5,0:15:49.04,0:15:51.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mmm. What a nice breeze!Dialogue: 5,0:15:51.69,0:15:54.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we'll make it to the  City of Water sooner than expected.Dialogue: 5,0:15:54.50,0:15:55.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hope so.Dialogue: 5,0:15:55.85,0:16:01.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, leave scouting out the shipwright to me.  I'll make sure she's incredibly attractive.Dialogue: 5,0:16:01.26,0:16:03.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you a moron?!  This is a shipwright we're talking about!Dialogue: 5,0:16:03.21,0:16:06.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be a big guy the size of  a mountain! Five meters tall!Dialogue: 5,0:16:06.90,0:16:11.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But if he's too big,  he might not fit on this ship.Dialogue: 5,0:16:11.49,0:16:14.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All that matters is  that he's skilled, right?Dialogue: 5,0:16:14.09,0:16:16.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The real issue is finding someone crazy enough...Dialogue: 5,0:16:16.20,0:16:18.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to agree to sailing on a pirate ship.Dialogue: 5,0:16:18.49,0:16:22.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't wait!  We're gonna make a new friend!Dialogue: 5,0:16:22.33,0:16:26.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were lucky to stop at the station first,  since they drew a map for us.Dialogue: 5,0:16:26.34,0:16:30.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we go to the place on the map  and find that Iceburg guy...Dialogue: 5,0:16:31.47,0:16:32.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Makes sense...Dialogue: 5,0:16:32.38,0:16:34.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This tells me nothing!Dialogue: 5,0:16:35.01,0:16:36.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! This is like something  Luffy would draw.Dialogue: 5,0:16:36.51,0:16:39.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here. We need to keep an eye out for a guy like this.Dialogue: 5,0:16:40.35,0:16:42.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If there was a guy like that, I'd run.Dialogue: 5,0:16:42.09,0:16:45.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Same here. I'd hop on the next ship and hightail it out to sea. Dialogue: 5,0:16:45.68,0:16:47.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But with this guy looking like an octopus,Dialogue: 5,0:16:47.72,0:16:49.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he might chase me out to the open water. Dialogue: 5,0:16:49.41,0:16:51.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you  guys going on about?!Dialogue: 5,0:16:51.24,0:16:52.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come here, guys!Dialogue: 5,0:16:52.70,0:16:55.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You each get an allowance to last you the week we're ashore.Dialogue: 5,0:16:55.87,0:16:57.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seriously?! Yaay! I'm first!Dialogue: 5,0:16:57.52,0:16:59.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! That's generous!Dialogue: 5,0:16:59.24,0:17:01.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Get in line!Dialogue: 5,0:17:02.56,0:17:05.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Allowance! Allowance! Allowance!Dialogue: 5,0:17:15.78,0:17:17.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You doin' okay, Usopp?Dialogue: 5,0:17:17.60,0:17:22.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This tinplate patchwork brings back  memories of battles and adventure.Dialogue: 5,0:17:22.89,0:17:27.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't help but gush over the thought of her upcoming repairs.Dialogue: 5,0:17:27.81,0:17:29.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– I get it, but...  – Hm?Dialogue: 5,0:17:29.65,0:17:32.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,our journey, especially since  entering the Grand Line,Dialogue: 5,0:17:32.06,0:17:34.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,has taken quite a toll on the Merry.Dialogue: 5,0:17:34.86,0:17:38.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The deck creaks, and the hull is pretty leaky.Dialogue: 5,0:17:38.41,0:17:41.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If nothing's done, that'll be it for both the ship and us.Dialogue: 5,0:17:41.95,0:17:44.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but we're filthy rich now.Dialogue: 5,0:17:44.95,0:17:48.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can make her good as new! No, even better than that!Dialogue: 5,0:17:49.26,0:17:50.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, then let's get more cannons!Dialogue: 5,0:17:50.90,0:17:52.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And we'll put a bronze statue on the deck!Dialogue: 5,0:17:53.26,0:17:54.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that it?Dialogue: 5,0:17:54.90,0:17:55.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 5,0:17:57.93,0:18:01.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the island! We can see the island!Dialogue: 5,0:18:02.81,0:18:05.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, guys! Row!Dialogue: 5,0:18:05.09,0:18:08.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got a decent tailwind.  Don't make us waste our energy!Dialogue: 5,0:18:18.28,0:18:19.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How wonderful!Dialogue: 5,0:18:21.70,0:18:22.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's incredible!Dialogue: 5,0:18:28.01,0:18:30.37,Main-207+,,0,0,8,,What is this place?!Dialogue: 5,0:18:39.59,0:18:41.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The fountain's enormous!Dialogue: 5,0:18:42.90,0:18:45.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable! An actual industrial city!Dialogue: 5,0:18:45.72,0:18:47.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why it has the sea train. Dialogue: 5,0:18:47.43,0:18:49.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The building just ahead must be the station. Dialogue: 5,0:18:50.41,0:18:52.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It says Blue Station.Dialogue: 5,0:18:54.13,0:18:55.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder where we dock.Dialogue: 5,0:18:55.61,0:18:56.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It must be in town.Dialogue: 5,0:18:57.69,0:19:00.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Hey, you there!  – Hm?Dialogue: 5,0:19:00.20,0:19:03.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not okay for you pirates  to openly sail out front!Dialogue: 5,0:19:03.60,0:19:05.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go around that way  to the backstreets!Dialogue: 5,0:19:06.81,0:19:09.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay! Thanks!Dialogue: 5,0:19:14.75,0:19:17.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this is amazing!  A city on the water?!Dialogue: 5,0:19:17.71,0:19:21.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow! This place is cool!  Such a pretty city!Dialogue: 5,0:19:29.94,0:19:34.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But the city is flooded.  The houses are submerged in the sea.Dialogue: 5,0:19:34.94,0:19:39.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look again. The city was designed  with its base underwater.Dialogue: 5,0:19:39.86,0:19:42.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Huh?  – You can see the foundation underneath.Dialogue: 5,0:19:43.09,0:19:45.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're right! The pillars  raise up the structures!Dialogue: 5,0:19:45.53,0:19:48.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. That's why it's called  the City of Water, huh?Dialogue: 5,0:19:49.20,0:19:51.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hurry up and dock the ship!Dialogue: 5,0:19:53.01,0:19:54.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 5,0:19:54.00,0:19:57.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, you guys!  Pirate ships should steer clear of this area!Dialogue: 5,0:19:57.92,0:20:00.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What'd you come here for?!  To plunder?!Dialogue: 5,0:20:00.45,0:20:03.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! We wanna get our ship repaired!Dialogue: 5,0:20:03.08,0:20:05.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it normal for people to straight up ask if we're here to plunder?Dialogue: 5,0:20:05.39,0:20:10.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In that case, there's a cape just ahead,  so anchor your ship there for now!Dialogue: 5,0:20:10.38,0:20:11.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 5,0:20:11.98,0:20:13.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks!Dialogue: 5,0:20:13.50,0:20:14.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Again?Dialogue: 5,0:20:14.81,0:20:17.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What'd you expect?  We're pirates, after all. Dialogue: 5,0:20:19.54,0:20:21.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This area should be okay,  don't you think?Dialogue: 5,0:20:21.60,0:20:25.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It sure is bleak though. Dialogue: 5,0:20:25.21,0:20:27.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, then! Furl the sail!Dialogue: 5,0:20:35.10,0:20:36.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?!Dialogue: 5,0:20:36.75,0:20:39.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nothing! All I did was pull the rope!Dialogue: 5,0:20:42.92,0:20:47.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me! The Going Merry is already this rickety?Dialogue: 5,0:20:48.80,0:20:52.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say, did you notice the people on this island aren't too scared of pirates?Dialogue: 5,0:20:52.35,0:20:55.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Probably because pirates are just  another customer for their shipyards.Dialogue: 5,0:20:55.62,0:20:58.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Less talking! More fixing!Dialogue: 5,0:20:58.11,0:21:01.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Could it be that their sentries are strong enough...Dialogue: 5,0:21:01.29,0:21:03.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to deal with pirates who cause a ruckus?Dialogue: 5,0:21:03.34,0:21:06.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They probably do,  considering the size of the city.Dialogue: 5,0:21:06.78,0:21:10.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that so?! Then what're  we gonna do? This is bad.Dialogue: 5,0:21:10.36,0:21:12.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why would it be bad?  We're customers.Dialogue: 5,0:21:12.79,0:21:14.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-You think so?Dialogue: 5,0:21:14.12,0:21:15.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, then! See you later!Dialogue: 5,0:21:15.68,0:21:17.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, Luffy! Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:21:19.04,0:21:21.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You two, come with me.Dialogue: 5,0:21:21.39,0:21:22.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 5,0:21:24.01,0:21:25.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where to?Dialogue: 5,0:21:25.10,0:21:28.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First, we'll take Kokoro-san's letter of introduction...Dialogue: 5,0:21:28.13,0:21:29.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and go find the man named Iceburg.Dialogue: 5,0:21:29.97,0:21:33.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll ask him to facilitate the ship's repair.Dialogue: 5,0:21:33.70,0:21:37.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then we gotta find a place  where we can cash in our gold.Dialogue: 5,0:21:37.06,0:21:42.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If that's it, then okay! Onward! To the City of Water!Dialogue: 5,0:21:42.57,0:21:44.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're forgetting the gold.Dialogue: 5,0:21:44.69,0:21:45.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah!Dialogue: 5,0:21:47.20,0:21:50.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! There're pirates making a scene at Dock One!Dialogue: 5,0:21:50.36,0:21:51.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! For real?!Dialogue: 5,0:21:51.87,0:21:54.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'd better hurry and see!Dialogue: 5,0:21:55.54,0:21:58.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what you're talkin' about.Dialogue: 5,0:21:58.07,0:22:00.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, actually,Dialogue: 5,0:22:03.51,0:22:06.20,Main-207+,,0,0,8,,I thought about it carefully.Dialogue: 5,0:22:06.20,0:22:09.31,Main-207+,,0,0,8,,I thought about it really carefully.Dialogue: 5,0:22:09.31,0:22:12.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,While it's true that you guys repaired our ship,Dialogue: 5,0:22:12.30,0:22:16.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I couldn't help but notice  the invoice was a bit too high.Dialogue: 5,0:22:17.80,0:22:20.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're interruptin' our work.Dialogue: 5,0:22:20.36,0:22:25.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, I decided not to pay —not one belly.Dialogue: 5,0:22:26.80,0:22:29.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the flawless repairs!Dialogue: 5,0:22:31.24,0:22:33.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Plus, it's all free! Dialogue: 5,0:22:44.71,0:22:47.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, Kalifa, what's going on over there?Dialogue: 5,0:22:47.60,0:22:50.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, Iceburg-san.  They're Dock One customers.Dialogue: 5,0:22:50.68,0:22:54.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that the work has been completed,  they're saying they won't pay.Dialogue: 5,0:22:54.14,0:22:56.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's sexual harassment.Dialogue: 5,0:22:56.60,0:22:59.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, that is sexual harassment.Dialogue: 5,0:23:09.78,0:23:14.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sir, you'd be wise not to provoke craftsmen like that.Dialogue: 5,0:23:25.56,0:23:27.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C-Captain!Dialogue: 5,0:23:27.46,0:23:29.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain!Dialogue: 5,0:23:30.27,0:23:31.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oops, pardon me.Dialogue: 5,0:23:31.43,0:23:36.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You son of a bitch!  You should watch where you're going!Dialogue: 5,0:23:38.48,0:23:40.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, pardon me.Dialogue: 5,0:23:40.44,0:23:45.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-You bastards! Are you picking a fight?!  Who in the hell do you think we are?!Dialogue: 5,0:23:55.16,0:23:58.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, have you test-fired the cannon?Dialogue: 5,0:23:58.79,0:24:00.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh. Not yet, sir.Dialogue: 5,0:24:03.46,0:24:07.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Who the hell are you guys?!Dialogue: 5,0:24:07.91,0:24:10.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You won't get away with this!Dialogue: 5,0:24:23.50,0:24:25.50,Main-207+,,0,0,8,,Pirate ways don't go over so well...Dialogue: 5,0:24:25.50,0:24:28.86,Main-207+,,0,0,8,,on craftsmen's turf, you hear?Dialogue: 5,0:24:30.30,0:24:32.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why don't we go to the exchange shop first?Dialogue: 5,0:24:32.61,0:24:35.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why? Let's go to the shipyard.Dialogue: 5,0:24:35.17,0:24:40.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we can't just walk around the island  with this much gold. It puts me on edge.Dialogue: 5,0:24:40.70,0:24:43.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't the value the same even after it's exchanged?Dialogue: 5,0:24:43.16,0:24:46.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even so, the size of our load might attract attention, don't you think?Dialogue: 5,0:24:46.83,0:24:48.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What if we run into thieves?Dialogue: 5,0:24:48.73,0:24:50.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we are thieves!Dialogue: 5,0:24:50.38,0:24:54.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's got a point. Trading it in for bills would mean we each hold on to some of it.Dialogue: 5,0:24:54.72,0:24:57.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's with that remark?Dialogue: 5,0:24:57.68,0:25:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you have a problem if I'm the only one carrying it?Dialogue: 5,0:25:00.00,0:25:02.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. You might drop  it somewhere or lose it.Dialogue: 5,0:25:02.51,0:25:04.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he would.  This is Luffy we're talking about.Dialogue: 5,0:25:04.73,0:25:07.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Guys!  Don't you trust me?!Dialogue: 5,0:25:07.61,0:25:11.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Nope!  – Ah... Ahh... Ahh... That really hurts!Dialogue: 5,0:25:11.20,0:25:14.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've really done it this ti– Hm?Dialogue: 5,0:25:14.90,0:25:18.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is this the only entrance to the city?Dialogue: 5,0:25:19.49,0:25:21.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A rental bull shop?Dialogue: 5,0:25:21.05,0:25:22.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that?Dialogue: 5,0:25:22.12,0:25:24.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do they rent out?Dialogue: 5,0:25:24.42,0:25:25.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's a "bull"?Dialogue: 5,0:25:25.79,0:25:28.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beats me. Bulldogs?Dialogue: 5,0:25:28.80,0:25:30.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't be, right?Dialogue: 5,0:25:30.00,0:25:32.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!  We'd like to rent your bull!Dialogue: 5,0:25:32.52,0:25:34.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ask what it is first!Dialogue: 5,0:25:35.42,0:25:38.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Welcome! You wanna rent bulls, right?  How many people?Dialogue: 5,0:25:38.39,0:25:39.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three!Dialogue: 5,0:25:39.51,0:25:41.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What kind of bulls would you like?Dialogue: 5,0:25:41.50,0:25:44.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There're three ranks:  yagara, rabuka, and king.Dialogue: 5,0:25:44.18,0:25:47.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, for the three of you,  two yagara would probably do.Dialogue: 5,0:25:47.32,0:25:49.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay! Please roast 'em  till they're nice and tasty!Dialogue: 5,0:25:49.27,0:25:50.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're making things weird, you weirdo!Dialogue: 5,0:25:51.70,0:25:54.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? You followed a log to get here?Dialogue: 5,0:25:54.44,0:25:57.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yep.  – That's quite the undertaking, you guys.Dialogue: 5,0:25:57.39,0:25:59.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then you had no idea  what bulls were, did you?Dialogue: 5,0:25:59.70,0:26:03.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Right.  – Well, to make a long story short, those are bulls.Dialogue: 5,0:26:03.29,0:26:05.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're yagara bulls.  They're everywhere in town.Dialogue: 5,0:26:05.96,0:26:10.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In this area, there's a fish called a yagara that swims with its head out.Dialogue: 5,0:26:10.24,0:26:13.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the City of Water.  There're more canals than walkways.Dialogue: 5,0:26:13.96,0:26:17.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So the residents here find bulls to be a necessary form of transportation.Dialogue: 5,0:26:18.30,0:26:20.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the same when you go sightseeing on this island.Dialogue: 5,0:26:20.76,0:26:22.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That fish is pulling a boat?Dialogue: 5,0:26:22.82,0:26:25.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Actually, rather than pulling,  they're letting people ride on their back.Dialogue: 5,0:26:25.43,0:26:29.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, it's like horseback riding  or riding in a carriage on land.Dialogue: 5,0:26:29.65,0:26:31.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Dialogue: 5,0:26:31.61,0:26:35.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You see the fish pen there?  Well, try and ride on one. It's comfortable.Dialogue: 5,0:26:36.40,0:26:40.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For two of the two-passenger yagara bulls,  it's 2,000 belly, all told.Dialogue: 5,0:26:40.26,0:26:41.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, they're cute!Dialogue: 5,0:26:41.74,0:26:44.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a fish that looks like a horse.Dialogue: 5,0:26:45.66,0:26:49.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You jerk! What'd you do that for?!Dialogue: 5,0:26:49.50,0:26:52.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? He must like you.  Let's get that one for you.Dialogue: 5,0:26:59.18,0:27:01.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can he carry heavy stuff okay?Dialogue: 5,0:27:01.39,0:27:05.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their power is incredible! They're often  used when moving household goods.Dialogue: 5,0:27:05.95,0:27:08.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That bag, huh? Whatcha got in there?Dialogue: 5,0:27:08.25,0:27:09.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gold.Dialogue: 5,0:27:10.29,0:27:13.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good one!  Whatever it is, they can handle it.Dialogue: 5,0:27:13.23,0:27:15.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– See?  – Whoa! Share the wealth!Dialogue: 5,0:27:15.12,0:27:16.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 5,0:27:16.04,0:27:18.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This old guy wears his heart on his sleeve.Dialogue: 5,0:27:18.03,0:27:20.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And you! Don't show it off  to others so casually!Dialogue: 5,0:27:20.70,0:27:22.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why's that?  It's no big deal. Dialogue: 5,0:27:22.69,0:27:24.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My, my, what a surprise.Dialogue: 5,0:27:24.74,0:27:28.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, then. It'll be a million belly  for two yagara bulls.Dialogue: 5,0:27:28.72,0:27:30.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, the price went up, pops.Dialogue: 5,0:27:30.58,0:27:33.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Incidentally, are there any  exchange shops around here?Dialogue: 5,0:27:33.33,0:27:37.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there are, but  with that amount of gold,Dialogue: 5,0:27:37.30,0:27:40.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the shops around here probably  wouldn't have enough money.Dialogue: 5,0:27:40.40,0:27:42.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should go to the downtown area of Shipyard Island.Dialogue: 5,0:27:42.89,0:27:46.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The downtown area of Shipyard Island? Where's that?Dialogue: 5,0:27:46.72,0:27:50.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In that direction.  Take this with you.Dialogue: 5,0:27:50.00,0:27:51.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A map?Dialogue: 5,0:27:52.01,0:27:53.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This'll be helpful! Thanks!Dialogue: 5,0:27:53.44,0:27:56.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pops, is the shipyard that way, too?Dialogue: 5,0:27:56.38,0:27:58.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. The world's number one shipyard!Dialogue: 5,0:27:58.81,0:28:02.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's perfect. Once we get the money,  we'll be real close to the shipyard.Dialogue: 5,0:28:02.95,0:28:06.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. We can finally have  the Going Merry repaired!Dialogue: 5,0:28:06.74,0:28:10.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And we'll find a shipwright, too!  I'm getting excited!Dialogue: 5,0:28:10.54,0:28:12.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Well, then.  – Shall we?Dialogue: 5,0:28:12.46,0:28:15.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right! Go, yagara!Dialogue: 5,0:28:17.30,0:28:20.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your business! Be careful!Dialogue: 5,0:28:20.63,0:28:23.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Full speed to the shipyard!Dialogue: 5,0:28:23.73,0:28:26.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.52,0:11:17.28,Captions,,0,0,0,,Chimney Kokoro's GrandchildDialogue: 1,0:11:15.52,0:11:17.28,Captions,,0,0,0,,Chimney Kokoro's GrandchildDialogue: 0,0:11:17.40,0:11:19.24,Captions,,0,0,0,,Gonbe A Cat (Actually a Rabbit)Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.40,0:11:19.24,Captions,,0,0,0,,Gonbe A Cat (Actually a Rabbit)Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.36,0:11:23.53,Captions,,0,0,0,,Stationmaster Kokoro Shift StationDialogue: 1,0:11:19.36,0:11:23.53,Captions,,0,0,0,,Stationmaster Kokoro Shift StationDialogue: 0,0:16:30.17,0:16:30.21,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,m 102 -114 l 222 -102 125 -7 49 122 1 185 -27 215 -104 130Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.21,0:16:30.26,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,m 102 -114 l 222 -102 125 -7 49 122 1 185 -27 215 -104 130Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.26,0:16:30.30,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,m 102 -114 l 222 -102 125 -7 49 122 1 185 -27 215 -104 130Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.30,0:16:30.34,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,m 102 -114 l 222 -102 125 -7 49 122 1 185 -27 215 -104 130Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.34,0:16:30.38,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,m 102 -114 l 222 -102 125 -7 49 122 1 185 -27 215 -104 130Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.38,0:16:30.42,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,m 102 -114 l 222 -102 125 -7 49 122 1 185 -27 215 -104 130Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.42,0:16:30.46,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,m 102 -114 l 222 -102 125 -7 49 122 1 185 -27 215 -104 130Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.46,0:16:30.51,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,m 102 -114 l 222 -102 125 -7 49 122 1 185 -27 215 -104 130Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.51,0:16:30.55,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,m 102 -114 l 222 -102 125 -7 49 122 1 185 -27 215 -104 130Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.55,0:16:30.59,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,m 102 -114 l 222 -102 125 -7 49 122 1 185 -27 215 -104 130Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.59,0:16:30.63,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,m 102 -114 l 222 -102 125 -7 49 122 1 185 -27 215 -104 130Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.63,0:16:30.67,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,m 102 -114 l 222 -102 125 -7 49 122 1 185 -27 215 -104 130Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.67,0:16:30.71,Sign-Map,,0,0,0,,m 102 -114 l 222 -102 125 -7 49 122 1 185 -27 215 -104 130Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.71,0