dtracking: Halee  Graphics: Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll, GaijinDialogue: 0,0:00:03.99,0:00:08.05,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,It's all right! It's time to move onDialogue: 0,0:00:08.31,0:00:11.59,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,The sun shines always in our heartsDialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:15.01,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Hand in hand, we convey our powerDialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:18.68,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,And make our wishes come trueDialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:32.49,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Combining our strengths, we'll crest these surging seasDialogue: 0,0:00:33.75,0:00:40.29,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,1,,Hurry toward the thrill of danger— Let the adventure begin!Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:47.13,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Now's the time to set sail; raise the anchorDialogue: 0,0:00:47.93,0:00:55.01,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Off to the seas of adventure, through rainbow-colored windsDialogue: 0,0:00:55.06,0:00:58.55,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Our journey's fraught with injuryDialogue: 0,0:00:58.56,0:01:02.27,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,But what we cherish most is right at our sideDialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:06.35,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,And if you get into a jamDialogue: 0,0:01:06.45,0:01:08.36,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,I'll always be there to protect youDialogue: 0,0:01:09.45,0:01:13.36,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,It's all right! It's time to move onDialogue: 0,0:01:13.66,0:01:16.82,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,The sun shines always in our heartsDialogue: 0,0:01:17.17,0:01:20.33,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Shoulder to shoulder, we face all coming stormsDialogue: 0,0:01:20.37,0:01:24.20,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,And look to the future for the light of hopeDialogue: 0,0:01:24.67,0:01:27.92,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,If we gather up the pieces of our dreamsDialogue: 0,0:01:28.39,0:01:31.55,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,They'll make a chart leading to tomorrowDialogue: 0,0:01:31.68,0:01:34.72,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,We come together under the same Jolly RogerDialogue: 0,0:01:35.10,0:01:40.45,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,And make our wishes come true; together, we are...Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.27,0